3. COMMERCIAL RESTRICTIONS

You may use CopyGuard Free as a tool in your own commercial work.

However, you may NOT:

a. Sell CopyGuard Free itself.

b. Resell, sublicense, rent, or commercially distribute CopyGuard Free.

c. Repackage CopyGuard Free, whether modified or unmodified, as part
